   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>以下为真实研究的数据准备建议，演示使用教学合成数据；建议规模并非已采集数量。勾选用于检查准备进度。</p><div class='research-prep'><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><b>真实应用数据准备清单</b><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>多井同步温度与工况</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：建议起步收集10口井、每井不少于1000个对齐时点</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：标记井深、排量、循环起止、传感器位置和温度单位</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井底温度监督值</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：与工况对齐的井底温度记录，保留原始采样率</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：记录工具响应延迟与校准信息；不能把返出温度当真值</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>按井划分验证集</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：建议至少20%的整井作为独立验证</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：分层报告井深、工具和停泵工况误差；建议规模不等于已采集</span></div></div></div>"
